---
title: "A lighthouse keeper's day"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> sleep
  sleep: 0:00 asleep under the light
  watch: 3:00 the night watch
  dawn: 6:00 dawn and breakfast
  lens: 9:00 polishing the lens
  radio: 12:00 the weather log
  foghorn: fog: the horn
  garden: 15:00 the garden and the oil
  supper: 18:00 supper
  night: 21:00 the light is on
  late_oil: 21:00 oil by lantern
  state lamp <<choice>>
  sleep --> watch: next step
  watch --> dawn: sunrise
  dawn --> lens: next step
  lens --> radio: next step
  radio --> garden: next step
  radio --> foghorn: fog rolls in
  foghorn --> garden: fog lifts
  garden --> garden: carry oil up [tank not full]
  garden --> supper: next step
  supper --> lamp: light the lamp
  lamp --> night: [lamp burns]
  lamp --> late_oil: [else]
  late_oil --> night: oil by lantern
  night --> sleep: next step
